<title>HUNGARY: Cen Euro bourses push CESI to record 1,561.57 pts.</title>
<headline>Cen Euro bourses push CESI to record 1,561.57 pts.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index rose to a record of 1,561.57 points on Thursday, up by 31.74 points or 2.07 percent, the Budapest Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The CESI firmed as shares on all the bourses in the index posted gains on Thursday.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, reflects trends of 73 shares on the Budapest, Prague, Warsaw, Bratislava and Ljubljana bourses.</p>
<p>The previous high was reached on September 2 last year, at 1,544.70 points.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
